      "id": 1,
      "text": "Bexley was founded in 1908 as a merger of Bullitt Park and Pleasant Ridge, meeting at National Road (Main Street).",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bexley%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s name came from an early resident, Col. Jeffrey, who suggested it during the merger.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bexley%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Capital University, founded 1850, and Trinity Lutheran Seminary, founded 1830, sit near Bexley’s historic core.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bexley%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Bexley Public Library’s Bexley Collection, launched for its 2024 centennial, archives historic photos, documents, and oral histories.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://bexleylibrary.org/local-history",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every summer, Bexley hosts Jazz in the Park at Havenwood Park, featuring local bands and food trucks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
